{"type":"message","id":"cf8f8898","parentId":"d822eda8","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:21:31.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"上次 openclawProject 检查：1774682300 (2026-03-28 14:38 UTC)，约 40 分钟前\n上次 heartbeat：1774685280 (2026-03-28 15:48 UTC)，约 30 分钟前\n上次主动汇报：1774652580 (2026-03-28 07:23 UTC)，约 8 小时前\n\n上一次主动汇报是 7:23，距离现在已经超过 8 小时了。\n\n根据主动提醒条件：\n- 距离上次主动汇报已超过 8 小时，且确实有新信息 → 需要检查\n\n我应该检查 OpenClaw 贡献项目是否有新进展。如果确实有新信息，我应该主动汇报。\n\n但是，我需要检查是否有新进展。让我看看能否通过 GitHub API 检查之前的 issue/PR 是否有新评论。\n\n从 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 看到的上次扫描是 2026-03-28 06:46（第十轮新发现）。\n\n我应该检查：\n1. #55995（严重安全漏洞）是否有新评论\n2. #55994（weixin release blocker）是否有新评论\n3. 其他高优先级 issue/PR 是否有新进展\n\n但是，我没有直接的 GitHub API 工具。我需要使用 gh CLI 或其他方式。\n\n让我尝试使用 gh CLI 检查这些 issue 是否有新评论。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"上次主动汇报是 7:23，距离现在（16:18）已经超过 8 小时。我应该检查 OpenClaw 贡献项目是否有新进展。\n\n让我检查几个关键 issue/PR 的新评论情况："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rvamjw97f53mim6tvylx91tw","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh issue view 55995 --json comments | jq '.comments | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_m2n21vw6rlv9ycqzh6irubvl","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh issue view 55994 --json comments | jq '.comments | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bu48mq57lmah84pxe73ehenl","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh issue view 56057 --json comments | jq '.comments | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_g7sogn1eim7kxa33gdyr6a18","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 55008 --json reviews | jq '.reviews | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_kvi6pqdarvc8lfwd9wc0w8mb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 55013 --json reviews | jq '.reviews | length'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":47642,"output":483,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48125,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774685933829,"responseId":"021774685934670d