{"type":"message","id":"323b9239","parentId":"756279b5","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:25:14.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我获取到了两个 issue 的内容：\n\n**#55995**：严重安全漏洞，/pair approve 绕过 admin scope guard\n- CVSS 评分：9.9/10.0（Critical severity）\n- 影响描述详细，有明确的技术复现步骤\n- 没有看到评论信息（可能是因为 web_fetch 只提取了 issue 描述）\n\n**#55994**：weixin 通道 regression，message action=send 被误判为 poll\n- 描述详细，有最小复现步骤\n- 标签：bug + regression\n- 没有看到评论信息\n\n从 web_fetch 的结果看，我只获取到了 issue 的描述内容，没有获取到评论信息。\n\n让我尝试使用 GitHub API 获取评论信息，或者检查是否有新的 activity。\n\n实际上，我应该使用 gh CLI 或 GitHub API 来获取评论信息。但是，gh CLI 需要在有 git remotes 的目录中运行。\n\n让我尝试使用 GitHub API 直接查询：","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"从 web_fetch 的结果看，我只获取到了 issue 的描述，没有获取到评论信息。\n\n让我尝试使用 GitHub API 检查这些 issue 的评论情况："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fg1g5mwn21h1r1evq6uoy9g4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55995/comments\" | jq '. | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ttvjrz7ti47x9b5u6a1tm3l7","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55994/comments\" | jq '. | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_s9qo5qetb89gkqhewc7o1nts","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/54952/comments\" | jq '. | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0knwrptir69fygg4wbq73kvk","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/54964/comments\" | jq '. | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_r8d3vnkyjsw2xxrlinr5vjzu","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/55008/reviews\" | jq '. | length'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_z76rmu2ejx5j2z0lhafn9ymy","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/55013/reviews\" | jq '. | length'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","