{"type":"message","id":"b66b5e35","parentId":"33787ace","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:26:40.254Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"太好了！现在我获取到了评论和 review 的数量：\n\n- #55995（严重安全漏洞）：2 条评论\n- #55994（weixin release blocker）：1 条评论\n- #54952（Diagnostics gap issue）：0 条评论（新发现，上次检查应该是 0 条）\n- #54964（Session zombie state）：0 条评论（新发现，上次检查应该是 0 条）\n- #55008（message channel docs）：1 条 review\n- #55013（feishu routing docs）：2 条 review\n\n从 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 看到之前的记录：\n- **#54952 / #54964**：仍 0 条 maintainer 新评论\n\n但是现在的结果显示：\n- #54952：0 条评论（没有变化）\n- #54964：0 条评论（没有变化）\n\n但是 #55995 和 #55994 有新评论！\n- #55995：2 条评论（上次是 0 条）\n- #55994：1 条评论（上次是 0 条）\n\n这是一个重要发现！这些高优先级 issue 有新评论，我需要检查评论内容并汇报。\n\n让我获取这些评论的详细内容。发现高优先级 issue 有新评论！让我获取详细的评论内容：","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1mc962vg8v9xfgmrmpzdfzpl","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55995/comments\" | jq '.[] | {user: .user.login, created_at: .created_at, body: .body}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_jwgcgbluv5xsc6jtpwoxgd6j","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55994/comments\" | jq '.[] | {user: .user.login, created_at: .created_at, body: .body}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":52880,"output":385,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53265,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774686315465,"responseId":"021774686316094d5207c26d0a58eb5efce990a189f397e7adddb"}}
{"type":"message","id":"73d7003b","parentId":"b66b5e35","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:26:40.703Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1mc962vg8v9xfgmrmpzdfzpl","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"user\": \"EronFan\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-28T04:45:37Z\",\n  \"body\": \"This vulnerability has been properly disclosed as a security issue at #56173. Closing this in favor of the security-labeled report. Thank you for the discovery.\"\n}\n{\n  \"user\": \"coygeek\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-28T05:02:24Z\",\n  \"body\": \"@EronFan \\n\\nGlad to know my discovery at #55995 successfully functioned as the upstream beta test for the 'properly disclosed' duplicate at #56173. \\n\\nFlawless issue management.\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":371,"aggregated":"{\n  \"user\": \"EronFan\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-28T04:45:37Z\",\n  \"body\": \"This vulnerability has been properly disclosed as a security issue at #56173. Closing this in favor of the security-labeled report. Thank you for the discovery.\"\n}\n{\n  \"user\": \"coygeek\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-28T05:02:24Z\",\n  \"body\": \"@EronFan \\n\\nGlad to know my discovery at #55995 successfully functioned as the upstream beta test for the 'properly disclosed' duplicate at #56173. \\n\\nFlawless issue management.\"\n}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774686400682}}
{"type":"message","id":"d62c0d24","parentId":"73d7003b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:26:40.723Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_jwgcgbluv5xsc6jtpwoxgd6j","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"user\": \"EronFan\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-28T05:29:42Z\",\n  \"body\": \"## 补充分析（OpenClaw 2026.3.24 验证）\\n\\n在 v2026.3.24 中确认此 bug 仍然存在。根因定位如下：\\n\\n### 根因\\ncommit `6dfd39c3`（Harden Telegram poll gating）在 `src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts` line 767-769 增加了全局 guard：\\n\\n```typescript\\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\\\&\\\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) {\\n  throw new Error('Poll fields require action \\\"poll\\\"...');\\n}\\n```\\n\\n这个 guard 放在 `runMessageAction()` **入口处**，而非 Telegram 专用路径内。因此它会拦截**所有通道**的 send 请求，包括 weixin。\\n\\n### 问题\\n对于 weixin 通道，即使调用方没有传任何 poll 相关字段，`hasPollCreationParams(params)` 仍可能在某些情况下返回 true（比如参数解析逻辑差异或 weixin 通道特有的字段被误识别为 poll 参数），导致纯文本 send 被错误拒绝。\\n\\n### 修复建议\\n将 poll 参数校验下放到 Telegram 专用 handler 内，而不是放在全局入口：\\n\\n```typescript\\n// src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts\\n\\n// 当前（有问题）：\\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\\\&\\\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) { ... }  // 全局拦截\\n\\n// 建议改为：\\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\\\&\\\\& channel === \\\"telegram\\\" \\\\&\\\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) { ... }  // 仅 Telegram\\n```\\n\\n或者在 weixin handler 入口单独加 channel 判断。\\n\\n---\\\\n*Reviewed by contributor via community analysis*\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":364,"aggregated":"{\n  \"user\": \"EronFan\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-03-28T05:29:42Z\",\n  \"body\": \"## 补充分析（OpenClaw 2026.3.24 验证）\\n\\n在 v2026.3.24 中确认此 bug 仍然存在。根因定位如下：\\n\\n### 根因\\ncommit `6dfd39c3`（Harden Telegram poll gating）在 `src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts` line 767-769 增加了全局 guard：\\n\\n```typescript\\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\\\&\\\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) {\\n  throw new Error('Poll fields require action \\\"poll\\\"...');\\n}\\n```\\n\\n这个 guard 放在 `runMessageAction()` **入口处**，而非 Telegram 专用路径内。因此它会拦截**所有通道**的 send 请求，包括 weixin。\\n\\n### 问题\\n对于 weixin 通道，即使调用方没有传任何 poll 相关字段，`hasPollCreationParams(params)` 仍可能在某些情况下返回 true（比如参数解析逻辑差异或 weixin 通道特有的字段被误识别为 poll 参数），导致纯文本 send 被错误拒绝。\\n\\n### 修复建议\\n将 poll 参数校验下放到 Telegram 专用 handler 内，而不是放在全局入口：\\n\\n```typescript\\n// src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts\\n\\n// 当前（有问题）：\\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\\\&\\\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) { ... }  // 全局拦截\\n\\n// 建议改为：\\nif (action === \\\"send\\\" \\\\&\\\\& channel === \\\"telegram\\\" \\\\&\\\\& hasPollCreationParams(params)) { ... }  // 仅 Telegram\\n```\\n\\n或者在 weixin handler 入口单独加 channel 判断。\\n\\n---\\\\n*Reviewed by contributor via community analysis*\"\n}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774686400703}}
{"type":"message","id":"947980a9","parentId":"d62c0d24","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:30:43.121Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"太好了！我获取到了评论内容：\n\n**#55995 评论分析**：\n1. EronFan（2026-03-28T04:45:37Z）：该漏洞已经作为安全问题在 #56173 正式披露，关闭此 issue，转向安全标签的报告\n2. coygeek（2026-03-28T05:02:24Z）：很高兴看到 #55995 的发现成功作为\"properly disclosed\"重复问题的上游 beta 测试。完美的 issue 管理。\n\n**#55994 评论分析**：\n1. EronFan（2026-03-28T05:29:42Z）：在 v2026.3.24 中确认此 bug 仍然存在，提供了详细的根因定位和修复建议：\n   - 根因：commit `6dfd39c3`（Harden Telegram poll gating）在 `src/infra/outbound/message-action-runner.ts` line 767-769 增加了全局 guard，这个 guard 放在 `runMessageAction()` 入口处，而非 Telegram 专用路径内\n   - 问题：会拦截所有通道的 send 请求，包括 weixin\n   - 修复建议：将 poll 参数校验下放到 Telegram 专用 handler 内，而不是放在全局入口\n\n这是很重要的新进展！我需要更新 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 并汇报给用户。\n\n让我也检查一下 PR 的 review 情况。我获取到了评论内容，发现了重要新进展！让我也检查 PR 的 review 情况：","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_oi1u1tcbhgjbw5jiv9p8jnws","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/55008/reviews\" | jq '.[] | {user: .user.login, state: .state, submitted_at: .submitted_at, body: .body}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8bbq1433ioyjesxl3difnc4o","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/pulls/55013/reviews\" | jq '.[] | {user: .user.login, state: .state, submitted_at: .submitted_at, body: .body}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":53855,"output":445,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54300,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774686400723,"responseId":"021774686401353d5207c26d0a58eb5efce990a189f397eb07996"}}
